erimentation framework enabling 3x more A/B tests per quarter\n      - Collaborated with sales team to close $2M in enterprise deals through product demos\n\n      Associate Product Manager | Atlassian | Austin, TX | Aug 2019 - May 2020\n      - Shipped 5 features for Jira's agile board, improving sprint planning efficiency\n      - Analyzed user behavior data to identify and fix top 3 workflow friction points\n      - Wrote PRDs and user stories for engineering team of 6 developers\n\n      Business Analyst | Deloitte Consulting | Houston, TX | July 2017 - July 2019\n      - Advised Fortune 500 clients on digital transformation strategy\n      - Built financial models for technology investment decisions\n      - Led requirements gathering workshops for enterprise software implementations\n\n      EDUCATION\n\n      MBA | McCombs School of Business, UT Austin | 2019\n      - Concentration: Technology Commercialization\n      - Product Management Club President\n\n      B.S. in Economics | Rice University | 2017\n      - Minor: Computer Science\n      - Cum Laude\n\n      SKILLS\n\n      Product: Roadmapping, user research, A/B testing, analytics, pricing strategy,\n        go-to-market planning, competitive analysis\n      Tools: Figma, Notion, Jira, Amplitude, Mixpanel, Looker, SQL, Python (basic),\n        Miro, Dovetail\n      Methodologies: Agile, Scrum, Jobs-to-be-Done, Design Thinking, OKRs\n      Domain: B2B SaaS, collaboration tools, productivity software, developer tools\n\n      CERTIFICATIONS\n      - Pragmatic Institute Certified Product Manager\n      - Google Analytics Certified\n      - Reforge Product Strategy Program (2023)\n\n      ACHIEVEMENTS\n      - Product Hunt: #3 Product of the Day for Notion real-time features launch\n      - Speaker at ProductCon Austin 2023: \"Building Products for the Async Workforce\"\n      - Featured in First Round Review: \"How We Prioritize Features at Notion\"\n\n      INTERESTS\n      - Angel investor in 3 early-stage B2B SaaS startups\n      - Mentor at Austin Product Meetup\n      - Avid rock climber and amateur coffee roaster\n","numLines":292,"startLine":1,"totalLines":292}}}}
